ec AC should have test with `// AC: @spec-ref ac-N` annotation\\n   - Trait AC coverage: run `kspec item get @spec-ref` to find inherited trait ACs (under \\\"Inherited from @trait-slug\\\" sections). Each needs test with `// AC: @trait-slug ac-N` annotation\\n   - Run `kspec validate` — trait AC coverage warnings are MUST-FIX\\n   - Spec alignment: implementation matches spec intent, not just syntax\\n   - Code quality: duplicated logic, ignored shared utilities, inconsistent patterns\\n   - Test quality: no fluff tests, prefer E2E over unit\\n5. Write a review body JSON file to /tmp/codex-pr-review-body.json:\\n   {\\\"event\\\":\\\"COMMENT\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"summary\\\",\\\"comments\\\":[{\\\"path\\\":\\\"file\\\",\\\"line\\\":N,\\\"body\\\":\\\"comment\\\"}]}\\n   Then post: gh api repos/chapel/kynetic-spec/pulls/466/reviews --method POST --input /tmp/codex-pr-review-body.json\\n6. Also write the full review to /tmp/codex-pr-466-review.md\\n\\nIMPORTANT: Do NOT use REQUEST_CHANGES event — use COMMENT for findings or APPROVE when clean.\\nIMPORTANT: Do NOT kill any processes. No pkill, kill, killall commands.\\n\\nIf no Task trailer exists, proceed with pure code review (skip AC checks).\\n\\nSeverity levels: MUST-FIX, SHOULD-FIX, SUGGESTION.\\nPROMPT_EOF\\necho \\\"Prompt file written\\\"\",\"description\":\"Write Codex prompt to temp file\"},\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"}}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":1,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":695,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":21752,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":695},\"output_tokens\":1,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\"}},\"requestId\":\"req_011CYQsmsjgZD6PfVRbvvQ5Q\",\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"c86219d5-3b24-4ca4-93ce-1be9dfe600fa\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-02-23T10:53:52.932Z\"}\n{\"parentUuid\":\"c86219d5-3b24-4ca4-93ce-1be9dfe600fa\",\"isSidechain\":true,\"userType\":\"external\",\"cwd\